  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agroecological Gardens in Schools in Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to the promotion and technical support of agroecological gardens in rural and urban schools in Argentina through training and advice spaces that promote adequate nutrition for children. We will train community leaders to be promoters in their educational communities. We will promote that the gardens are spaces for comprehensive curricular learning, spaces for children to be trained as future promoters of environmental care.</narrative>
  </description>
